  "mechanism": "The R10I measured-joint flexed ramp and its DLL are unchanged. When the native reference ramp is complete with four native supports on the same completed step, the ramp session is finalized and the next frame opens a separate zero-amplitude session under the unchanged V50 startup policy through the existing facade, with the same exact perpendicular-axis start rule as the neutral start and zero planar velocity on every command including the first. The unchanged 30 consecutive measured-ready samples are counted only inside that hold; on the thirtieth the hold session is finalized and fresh V50 walking memory starts exactly as before. Ramp and hold each stop at 240 commands as bounded negatives.",
